Hmm, I think from @maflcko  description of the deadlock issue on the reindex path https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35621#issuecomment-4864984742, requesting shutdown does not mean we shut down regardless.

```suggestion
   // The fatal error notification inside FlushStateToDisk still fires, so
   // unrecoverable flush errors requests node shutdown.

```

